# Schema change protection

Schema changes require:

- migration plan (toolchain, not ad-hoc prod DDL)
- rollback strategy
- compatibility analysis
- data safety assessment

Never auto-run destructive schema changes. Invoke `/sql` (MIGRATE mode) and get explicit prod confirmation when needed.
